  "ruleText": "Env-A 3302.01 References. For the purpose of this chapter, unless otherwise specified all references to 40 CFR 60 or 40 CFR 241 shall be to the July 1, 2016 edition.\n\nSource. #6518-B, eff 5-29-97; ss by #7704, eff 6-7-02; ss by #9084, eff 2-2-08; ss by #11131, eff 7-18-16; ss by #12628, eff 9-27-18",
